        <div class="space-y-12">
            <header>
                <h2 class="h2default mb-2">Security Features</h2>
                <p>Explore and learn the security features of Brunei banknotes to enable you to verify the authenticity of the banknotes you have or receive.</p>
                <nav class="mt-6">
                    <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:gap-3">
                        <li class="rounded-md border-[1px] transition-none border-black hover:bg-green hover:text-white hover:border-green active:bg-green/80" theme="green" title="Polymer banknotes" quicklinkto="#focus1">
    <a href="#focus1" class="block p-3 hover:opacity-100">Polymer banknotes</a>
</li>
                        <li class="rounded-md border-[1px] transition-none border-black hover:bg-green hover:text-white hover:border-green active:bg-green/80" theme="green" title="Paper banknotes" quicklinkto="#focus2">
    <a href="#focus2" class="block p-3 hover:opacity-100">Paper banknotes</a>
</li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
            </header>
            <section id="focus1" class="space-y-12">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="h4default mb-2">Polymer banknotes</h3>
                    <nav class="mt-6">
                        <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:gap-3">
                            <li class="rounded-md border-[1px] transition-none border-black hover:bg-green hover:text-white hover:border-green active:bg-green/80" theme="green" title="2025" quicklinkto="#2025">
    <a href="#2025" class="block p-3 hover:opacity-100">2025</a>
</li>
                            <li class="rounded-md border-[1px] transition-none border-black hover:bg-green hover:text-white hover:border-green active:bg-green/80" theme="green" title="2011" quicklinkto="#2011">
    <a href="#2011" class="block p-3 hover:opacity-100">2011</a>
</li>
                        </ul>
                    </nav>
                </div>
                <section id="2025" class="space-y-12">
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="h4 mb-2 font-secondary font-bold text-gray">2025</h4>
                        <nav class="mt-6">
                            <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:gap-3">
                                <li class="rounded-md border-[1px] transition-none border-black hover:bg-green hover:text-white hover:border-green active:bg-green/80" theme="green" title="BND1" quicklinkto="#2025-bnd1">
    <a href="#2025-bnd1" class="block p-3 hover:opacity-100">BND1</a>
</li>
                                <li class="rounded-md border-[1px] transition-none border-black hover:bg-green hover:text-white hover:border-green active:bg-green/80" theme="green" title="BND5" quicklinkto="#2025-bnd5">
    <a href="#2025-bnd5" class="block p-3 hover:opacity-100">BND5</a>
</li>
