    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                3. VIVID White™ and ultraviolet elements
            </p>
                                    <p>Under UV light a vertical asymmetric serial number fluoresce orange in colour. Look for hidden designs that fluoresce white in the form of a thread, a circular numerical pattern in the centre and the denomination value on the lower right edge of the note. The national crest also fluoresce red in colour.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
