    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd1-4.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd1-4.webp" title="4. Serial Numbers" desp="Look for a red to blue horizontal asymmetric serial number printed on the bottom left side of the note." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                4. Serial Numbers
            </p>
                                    <p>Look for a red to blue horizontal asymmetric serial number printed on the bottom left side of the note.</p>
                
