    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd1-5.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd1-5.webp" title="5. Dolar" desp="In accordance to the Currency Order, 2004, the unit of currency of Brunei Darussalam is Brunei Dollar and abbreviated form is B$ or BND." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                5. Dolar
            </p>
                                    <p>In accordance to the Currency Order, 2004, the unit of currency of Brunei Darussalam is Brunei Dollar and abbreviated form is B$ or BND.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd1-6.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd1-6.webp" title="6. AURORA™ (colour shifting ink)" desp="Tilt the note and the edges of the window will colour shift from gold to green. A traditional pattern in the large window will colour shift from gold to brown." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                6. AURORA™ (colour shifting ink)
            </p>
                                    <p>Tilt the note and the edges of the window will colour shift from gold to green. A traditional pattern in the large window will colour shift from gold to brown.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd1-7.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd1-7.webp" title="7. METALIX™ (metallic ink)" desp="When tilted a metallic blue sheen in the shape of a vertical pattern appears on the right side of the note." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
