    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                8. Polymer Substrate
            </p>
                                    <p>Feel the texture of the banknote. The banknotes are made of durable polymer substrate and its texture should feel smooth to the touch with raised ink in some areas.</p>
                
