                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-1.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-1.webp" title="1. Transparent Window" desp="Look for a vertical see through window featuring a cameo image of the Jame Asr Hassanil Bolkiah Mosque." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                1. Transparent Window
            </p>
                                    <p>Look for a vertical see through window featuring a cameo image of the Jame Asr Hassanil Bolkiah Mosque.</p>
                
