    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-3.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-3.webp" title="3. VIVID White™ and ultraviolet elements" desp="Under UV light a vertical asymmetric serial number appears in blue colour. Look for hidden designs that fluoresce white in the form of a thread, a circular numerical pattern in the centre and the denomination value on the lower right edge of the note. The national crest also fluoresce red in colour." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                3. VIVID White™ and ultraviolet elements
            </p>
                                    <p>Under UV light a vertical asymmetric serial number appears in blue colour. Look for hidden designs that fluoresce white in the form of a thread, a circular numerical pattern in the centre and the denomination value on the lower right edge of the note. The national crest also fluoresce red in colour.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-4.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-4.webp" title="4. Serial Numbers" desp="Look for a red to blue horizontal asymmetric serial number printed on the bottom left side of the note." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                4. Serial Numbers
            </p>
                                    <p>Look for a red to blue horizontal asymmetric serial number printed on the bottom left side of the note.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-5.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-5.webp" title="5. Dolar" desp="In accordance to the Currency Order, 2004, the unit of currency of Brunei Darussalam is Brunei Dollar and abbreviated form is B$ or BND." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                5. Dolar
            </p>
                                    <p>In accordance to the Currency Order, 2004, the unit of currency of Brunei Darussalam is Brunei Dollar and abbreviated form is B$ or BND.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-6.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-6.webp" title="6. AURORA™ (colour shifting ink)" desp="Tilt the note and the edges of the window will colour shift from blue to brown. A traditional pattern in the large window will colour shift from blue to green." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                6. AURORA™ (colour shifting ink)
            </p>
                                    <p>Tilt the note and the edges of the window will colour shift from blue to brown. A traditional pattern in the large window will colour shift from blue to green.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-7.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-7.webp" title="7. METALIX™ (metallic ink)" desp="When tilted a metallic copper sheen in the shape of a vertical pattern appears on the right side of the note." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                7. METALIX™ (metallic ink)
            </p>
                                    <p>When tilted a metallic copper sheen in the shape of a vertical pattern appears on the right side of the note.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-8.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-8.webp" title="8. Polymer Substrate" desp="Feel the texture of the banknote. The banknotes are made of durable polymer substrate and its texture should feel smooth to the touch with raised ink in some areas." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                8. Polymer Substrate
            </p>
                                    <p>Feel the texture of the banknote. The banknotes are made of durable polymer substrate and its texture should feel smooth to the touch with raised ink in some areas.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-9.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-9.webp" title="9. Raised Ink" desp="Feel the texture of raised ink on the front of the note in the portrait areas and text &quot;Negara Brunei Darussalam&quot;." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                9. Raised Ink
            </p>
                                    <p>Feel the texture of raised ink on the front of the note in the portrait areas and text &quot;Negara Brunei Darussalam&quot;.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-10.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-10.webp" title="10. Bunga Jambangan Pattern" desp="Look for a pattern in the shape of a bunga jambangan." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                10. Bunga Jambangan Pattern
            </p>
                                    <p>Look for a pattern in the shape of a bunga jambangan.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-11.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-11.webp" title="11. Ultraviolet Elements" desp="Under UV light, a hidden BDCB logo will appear on the upper right side and the text &quot;Brunei Darussalam Central Bank&quot; will fluoresce yellow." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                11. Ultraviolet Elements
            </p>
                                    <p>Under UV light, a hidden BDCB logo will appear on the upper right side and the text &quot;Brunei Darussalam Central Bank&quot; will fluoresce yellow.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-10.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-10.webp" title="12. SPARK® Live Sandune (colour shifting ink)" desp="A colour shifting pattern in the shape of a bunga jambangan that changes colour from gold to green." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                12. SPARK® Live Sandune (colour shifting ink)
            </p>
                                    <p>A colour shifting pattern in the shape of a bunga jambangan that changes colour from gold to green.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-13.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36 drop-shadow-banknote" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2025/bnd10-13.webp" title="13. Polymer Substrate" desp="Feel the texture of the banknote. The banknotes are made of durable polymer substrate and its texture should feel smooth to the touch." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                13. Polymer Substrate
            </p>
                                    <p>Feel the texture of the banknote. The banknotes are made of durable polymer substrate and its texture should feel smooth to the touch.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                        </div>
                    </section>
