                    <section id="2011-bnd1">
                        <h4 class="h4 mb-6 text-green">BND1</h4>
                        <div class="mb-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
                            <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 md:gap-3">
                                <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-front.webp" alt="BND1 note">
                                <p class="font-bold text-gold">OBVERSE (FRONT) SIDE</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 md:gap-3">
                                <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-back.webp" alt="BND1 note">
                                <p class="font-bold text-gold">REVERSE (BACK) SIDE</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12 lg:gap-x-16">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-1.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-1.webp" title="1. Complex Clear Window" desp="Omar 'Ali Saifuddien Mosque and the ceremonial barge form the complex clear window design incorporating a shadow image and vignette of '1' numeral." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                1. Complex Clear Window
            </p>
                                    <p>Omar 'Ali Saifuddien Mosque and the ceremonial barge form the complex clear window design incorporating a shadow image and vignette of '1' numeral.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-1.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-1.webp" title="2. G-Switch Feature" desp="Dynamic optical feature alternates between gold and blue when viewed at varying angles." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                2. G-Switch Feature
            </p>
                                    <p>Dynamic optical feature alternates between gold and blue when viewed at varying angles.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-3.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-3.webp" title="3. Shadow Image" desp="Features His Majesty's portrait. Initials &quot;HB&quot; and a section of the mosque will appear when the banknote is raised to the light." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                3. Shadow Image
            </p>
                                    <p>Features His Majesty's portrait. Initials &quot;HB&quot; and a section of the mosque will appear when the banknote is raised to the light.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-4.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-4.webp" title="4. See Through Feature" desp="A flower design is formed through the combination of front and back printing in perfect registration when the note is held up to the light." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                4. See Through Feature
            </p>
                                    <p>A flower design is formed through the combination of front and back printing in perfect registration when the note is held up to the light.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-5.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-5.webp" title="5. Offset" desp="Complex fine line background in rainbow print with fluorescing elements illuminate under ultraviolet light." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                5. Offset
            </p>
                                    <p>Complex fine line background in rainbow print with fluorescing elements illuminate under ultraviolet light.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-6.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-6.webp" title="6. Intaglio" desp="His Majesty's portrait, the red Crest of Brunei Darussalam, the flower design, and the surrounding text are printed in multicoloured raised ink." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                6. Intaglio
            </p>
                                    <p>His Majesty's portrait, the red Crest of Brunei Darussalam, the flower design, and the surrounding text are printed in multicoloured raised ink.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-7.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-7.webp" title="7. Braille Feature" desp="Raised printing of the Braille '1' for the visually impaired." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                7. Braille Feature
            </p>
                                    <p>Raised printing of the Braille '1' for the visually impaired.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-8.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd1-8.webp" title="8. Fluorescing Serial Numbers" desp="Vertical and horizontal serial numbers on the front are printed in varying sizes which fluoresce in yellow/green under ultraviolet light." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                8. Fluorescing Serial Numbers
            </p>
                                    <p>Vertical and horizontal serial numbers on the front are printed in varying sizes which fluoresce in yellow/green under ultraviolet light.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                    <hr>
