                            <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd5-3.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/bnd5-3.webp" title="3. Shadow Image" desp="Features His Majesty's portrait. Initials &quot;HB&quot; and a section of the Lapau will appear when the banknote is raised to the light." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                3. Shadow Image
            </p>
                                    <p>Features His Majesty's portrait. Initials &quot;HB&quot; and a section of the Lapau will appear when the banknote is raised to the light.</p>
                
    </div>
