            <section id="focus2" class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="h4default mb-2">Paper banknotes</h3>
                    <p>Here are the security features of Brunei's paper banknotes:</p>
                </div>
                <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12 lg:gap-x-16">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/gold-foil-bnd50.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/gold-foil-bnd50.webp" title="Gold Foil - B$50/B$100" year="(1996 series)" desp="A gold foil star surrounding the intitial 'HB', also made in the same material." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                Gold Foil - B$50/B$100
            </p>
                            <p class="!mt-0 pb-1 text-gold">(1996 series)</p>
                            <p>A gold foil star surrounding the intitial 'HB', also made in the same material.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/lift-twin-numerical.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/lift-twin-numerical.webp" title="Lift Twin (Numerical)" year="(1996 series)" desp="Multi-layered latent image displaying numerical value of 100." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                Lift Twin (Numerical)
            </p>
                            <p class="!mt-0 pb-1 text-gold">(1996 series)</p>
                            <p>Multi-layered latent image displaying numerical value of 100.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/hologram-bnd500.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/hologram-bnd500.webp" title="Hologram - B$500" year="(2000 series)" desp="Hologram displaying numerical value of 500 alongside 'HB'." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                Hologram - B$500
            </p>
                            <p class="!mt-0 pb-1 text-gold">(2000 series)</p>
