    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                Lift Twin - B$500
            </p>
                            <p class="!mt-0 pb-1 text-gold">(1996 series)</p>
                            <p>Multi-layered latent image displaying numerical value of 500.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/lift-twin-jawi.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/lift-twin-jawi.webp" title="Lift Twin (Jawi)" year="(1996 series)" desp="Multi-layered latent image reading 'Brunei' in Jawi." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                Lift Twin (Jawi)
            </p>
                            <p class="!mt-0 pb-1 text-gold">(1996 series)</p>
                            <p>Multi-layered latent image reading 'Brunei' in Jawi.</p>
                
