                    <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/window-security-thread-reflection.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/window-security-thread-reflection.webp" title="Window Security Thread - Reflection" desp="Security thread can be seen as rectangles with 'NBD 100' or 'NBD 500' which forms a dotted line on the surface, and a solid line when viewed against light." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                Window Security Thread - Reflection
            </p>
                                    <p>Security thread can be seen as rectangles with 'NBD 100' or 'NBD 500' which forms a dotted line on the surface, and a solid line when viewed against light.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/front-to-back-registration.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/front-to-back-registration.webp" title="Front to Back Registration" desp="Motifs are printed on the front
                    and back of the backnote. The motif on the front and back aligns when the banknote is held up against the light." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                Front to Back Registration
            </p>
                                    <p>Motifs are printed on the front
                    and back of the backnote. The motif on the front and back aligns when the banknote is held up against the light.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/watermark-transmission.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/watermark-transmission.webp" title="Watermark Transmission" desp="Watermark portrait of His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan of Brunei Darussalam is present on the banknote." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                Watermark Transmission
            </p>
                                    <p>Watermark portrait of His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan of Brunei Darussalam is present on the banknote.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/window-security-thread-transmission.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/window-security-thread-transmission.webp" title="Window Security Thread - Transmission" desp="Security thread can be seen as a solid line when the banknote is raised against the light." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                Window Security Thread - Transmission
            </p>
                                    <p>Security thread can be seen as a solid line when the banknote is raised against the light.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-6">
    <img src="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/fluorescence-feature.webp" class="h-20 w-20 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-36 lg:w-36" size="lg" imgsrc="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/img/currency/security-features/2011/fluorescence-feature.webp" title="Fluoresence Feature Under UV Light" desp="Brunei Darussalam's National Crest can be seen when the banknote is viewed under UV light." alt="icon" width="150" height="150">
    <div class="space-y-1">
                    <p class="h6default font-bold">
                Fluoresence Feature Under UV Light
            </p>
                                    <p>Brunei Darussalam's National Crest can be seen when the banknote is viewed under UV light.</p>
                
    </div>
</div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
</div>
